title: "RTPA — Output-Aware Recurrent-State Quantization"
version: 1.3.0rc1
type: software
authors:
  - name: "Munsik-Kim"
    website: "https://github.com/Munsik-Kim"
repository-code: "https://github.com/Munsik-Kim/rtpa-research"
url: "https://github.com/Munsik-Kim/rtpa-research"
license: Apache-2.0
date-released: 2026-09-12
abstract: "Output-aware recurrent-state quantization through fixed precision masks and bounded integer-code correction. Includes controlled codec-and-mask diagnostics, matched promotion/query/temporal-response allocation controls, exact adjoint and row-chunked calibration, and CPU-recomputable all-layer GDN observations. Rejected codec candidates and uncertified sketches remain explicit research results, not recommended defaults. Earlier FA_CODE and independent GDN2 operator evidence remains distinct. Quality, storage, numerical boundaries and runtime are reported separately; pretrained GDN2 language quality and production readiness are not claimed."
